(mithril/ontology
  :id "https://mithril.fund/ontology/workspace-ops-v1"
  :profile
  ["https://www.w3.org/TR/rdf11-concepts/"
   "https://www.w3.org/TR/owl2-profiles/#OWL_2_RL"
   "https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/"]
  :graph
  [;; ================================================================
   ;; workspace-ops-v1: common SaaS vocabulary for Mithril Workspace.
  ;;
   ;; Premises (Organizer Item 323 P0, plan 2026-11-25 appendix):
   ;;  - SaaS binding: D1 `workspaces` (migration 0075): kind personal /
   ;;    organization, `billing_account_id` always present. mithril.fund
   ;;    itself is the first tenant (`fund_mithril`), dogfooding.
   ;;  - First area: configuration drift detection (declared vs observed).
   ;;  - Staging only, no production writes. Automation created stopped.
   ;;    Secrets by NAME only, never values. No PII (see PartyRole).
   ;;
   ;; Namespace: https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1# (WOPS) is a
   ;; FRESH namespace shared by all tenants. Zero collisions: the IRI
   ;; `https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#...` appears nowhere else
   ;; in this repository (check: grep -r "workspace-ops" ontology/ src/
   ;; test/). Ontology IRI: https://mithril.fund/ontology/workspace-ops-v1 .
   ;;
   ;; Reuse (referenced, NEVER redefined here):
   ;;  - bot-domain-v1 `Activity` / `Run` / `Fact`:
   ;;      WOPS:Automation                      -> Activity
   ;;      WOPS:DriftCheck                      -> Run
   ;;      WOPS:Evidence                        -> Fact
   ;;    Subclassing gives IS-A entailment (a DriftCheck IS a Run,
   ;;    typed by inference), but this SHACL engine's sh:target-class
   ;;    does NOT climb subclasses (verified: a DriftCheck without
   ;;    runId raised no violation through RunShape alone). So the
   ;;    bot-domain Run/Fact required properties are mirrored as
   ;;    explicit property shapes on DriftCheckShape / EvidenceShape.
   ;;  - state-graph-v1 `RootState`:
   ;;      WOPS:DeclaredConfig / WOPS:ObservedState -> RootState
   ;;    (hence MapNode entries; drift = snapshot difference).
   ;; DM2 2.02 alignment is by metamodel TERM NAME. No pinned DM2 .mith
   ;; exists in this repo (only `test/fixtures/reason/dm2-mini.mith`,
   ;; which uses example.org IRIs), so there is NOTHING to import;
   ;; WOPS classes below map to DM2 terms in comments and add no new
   ;; DM2-vocab IRIs:
   ;;   Capability  -> WOPS:Capability          (DM2 Capability)
   ;;   Service     -> WOPS:Service             (DM2 System / Service)
   ;;   Bot         -> WOPS:Bot                 (DM2 Performer)
   ;;   Policy      -> WOPS:Policy              (DM2 Rule)
   ;;   Agreement   -> WOPS:Agreement           (DM2 Agreement)
   ;;   Party       -> WOPS:Party               (DM2 Performer role:
   ;;                     organizations and sub-processors only)
   ;;   Product     -> WOPS:Product             (DM2 System, commercial
   ;;                     packaging carved out for catalog use)
   ;; Terms with no DM2/bot-domain/state-graph counterpart in this repo
   ;; are defined once here as WOPS extensions (allowed by Item 323):
   ;; Workspace, WorkspaceGraph, Permission, ExtensionDraft, Decision,
   ;; Requirement, ApiOperation, McpTool, DataContract,
   ;; Binding, Environment, Deployment, Route, SecretRef,
   ;; Automation, Schedule, PartyRole, Obligation, Term, drift fields.
   ;; Note: bot-agent-v1 `BotProfile` (ns/v1#) is NOT subclassed: it
   ;; models an agent profile, not a workspace-deployed bot identity.
   ;;
   ;; Obligation -> Policy -> Implementation -> Evidence chain:
   ;;   Obligation <- Policy (WOPS:addresses)
   ;;   Policy     -> Implementation (WOPS:implementedBy; Service /
   ;;                 ApiOperation / Route subclass Implementation)
   ;;   Impl.      -> Evidence (WOPS:provenBy; Evidence subclasses
   ;;                 bot-domain:Fact)
   ;; Example (ZDR): obligation "ZDR on inference routes" addressed by
   ;; policy "ZDR by default", implemented by a Service, proven by
   ;; Evidence(kind=ci).
   ;;
   ;; TENANT-EXTENSION RULES (decision, Item 323 appendix):
   ;;  1. Common vocabulary is NEVER rewritten. This file is the pinned
   ;;     common vocabulary: changed only by git PR + compile-ontology.
   ;;  2. Tenant extensions are workspace-scoped DRAFTS: held per
   ;;     workspace (WOPS:ExtensionDraft rows with workspace,
   ;;     draftDigest, draftStatus in {draft, promoted, deprecated}),
   ;;     never merged into the common graph. A draft MUST NOT
   ;;     redefine any IRI declared in this file.
   ;;  3. Booking: a draft's status starts at `draft`; `promoted` means
   ;;     adoption via git PR (the only path into common vocabulary).
   ;; SHACL cannot check subject namespaces, so rule 2 is encoded as
   ;; comments + the ExtensionDraftShape lifecycle envelope (draft
   ;; requires workspace + digest, status is a closed enum), NOT as
   ;; fake "no-override" axioms. The digest pins the exact draft
   ;; artifact bytes somebody reviewed.
   ;;
   ;; Privacy / secrets:
   ;;  - SecretRef carries NAME + LOCATION only. Its shape is
   ;;    sh:closed: any value-carrying property (e.g. a secretValue)
   ;;    is a SHACL violation, not just a convention.
   ;;  - Party = organizations / sub-processors. Persons appear only
   ;;    as PartyRole (role-kind strings; no names, IDs, birth dates,
   ;;    addresses, or contact details — cf. world-v1 Person scope).
   ;;  - Party.name / Service.name etc. are employment-contract-free
   ;;    labels, not personal data.
   ;;
   ;; Sandbox: this file is schema + SHACL only. No ingestion, no
   ;; statements, no automations, no production writes.
   ;; Positive/negative SHACL examples: test/fixtures/workspace-ops/
   ;;   conforming.nq  (must validate: mithril reason, exit 0)
   ;;   violating.nq   (must fail: Closed/MinCount/In/Pattern/Datatype)
   ;;   also exercised by test/mithril/workspace_ops_test.cljk.
   ;;
   ;; ---- Tenant / workspace scaffolding ----
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#WorkspaceGraph")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Permission")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#ExtensionDraft")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#name")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspaceId"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspaceKind"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#billingAccountRef"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#graphIri"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#WorkspaceGraph")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#visibility"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#WorkspaceGraph")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#permissionScope"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Permission")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#draftDigest"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#ExtensionDraft")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#draftStatus"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#ExtensionDraft")
   (owl/object-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspace"
     :rdfs/range "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace")
   (shacl/node-shape
     :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#WorkspaceShape"
     :sh/target-class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace"
     :sh/property
     [(shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspaceId"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/pattern "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{1,63}$"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspaceKind"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/in [(rdf/literal "personal") (rdf/literal "organization")]
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#billingAccountRef"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)])
   (shacl/node-shape
     :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#WorkspaceGraphShape"
     :sh/target-class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#WorkspaceGraph"
     :sh/property
     [(shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspace"
        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#graphIri"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/pattern "^graph/[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{1,63}$"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#visibility"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/in [(rdf/literal "private")]
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)])
   (shacl/node-shape
     :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#PermissionShape"
     :sh/target-class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Permission"
     :sh/property
     [(shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspace"
        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#permissionScope"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/in [(rdf/literal "consumer") (rdf/literal "builder")]
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)])
   (shacl/node-shape
     :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#ExtensionDraftShape"
     :sh/target-class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#ExtensionDraft"
     :sh/property
     [(shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspace"
        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#draftDigest"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/pattern "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#draftStatus"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/in [(rdf/literal "draft") (rdf/literal "promoted") (rdf/literal "deprecated")]
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)])

   ;; ---- Spec ----
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Product")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Capability")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Requirement")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Decision")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#ApiOperation"
     :rdfs/sub-class-of "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Implementation")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Implementation")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#McpTool")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#DataContract")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Policy")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#operationId"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#ApiOperation")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#tableName"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#DataContract")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#contractVersion"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#DataContract")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#decisionId"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Decision")
   (owl/object-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#addresses"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Policy"
     :rdfs/range "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Obligation")
   (owl/object-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#implementedBy"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Policy"
     :rdfs/range "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Implementation")
   (owl/object-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#provenBy"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Implementation"
     :rdfs/range "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Evidence")
   (shacl/node-shape
     :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#ProductShape"
     :sh/target-class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Product"
     :sh/property
     [(shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#name"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspace"
        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)])
   (shacl/node-shape
     :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#CapabilityShape"
     :sh/target-class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Capability"
     :sh/property
     [(shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#name"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspace"
        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)])
   (shacl/node-shape
     :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#RequirementShape"
     :sh/target-class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Requirement"
     :sh/property
     [(shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#name"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspace"
        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)])
   (shacl/node-shape
     :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#DecisionShape"
     :sh/target-class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Decision"
     :sh/property
     [(shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#name"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#decisionId"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/pattern "^[0-9]{4}$"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspace"
        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)])
   (shacl/node-shape
     :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#ApiOperationShape"
     :sh/target-class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#ApiOperation"
     :sh/property
     [(shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#name"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#operationId"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/pattern "^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_]{1,80}$"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspace"
        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)])
   (shacl/node-shape
     :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#McpToolShape"
     :sh/target-class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#McpTool"
     :sh/property
     [(shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#name"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspace"
        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)])
   (shacl/node-shape
     :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#DataContractShape"
     :sh/target-class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#DataContract"
     :sh/property
     [(shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#name"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#tableName"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#contractVersion"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspace"
        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)])
   (shacl/node-shape
     :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#PolicyShape"
     :sh/target-class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Policy"
     :sh/property
     [(shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#name"
        :sh/datatype "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#workspace"
        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#addresses"
        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Obligation"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)
      (shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#implementedBy"
        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Implementation"
        :sh/min-count 0 :sh/max-count 8192)])
   (shacl/node-shape
     :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#ImplementationShape"
     :sh/target-class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Implementation"
     :sh/property
     [(shacl/property-shape
        :sh/path "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#provenBy"
        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Evidence"
        :sh/min-count 0 :sh/max-count 8192)])

   ;; ---- Configuration ----
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Service"
     :rdfs/sub-class-of "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Implementation")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Binding")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Environment")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Deployment")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Route"
     :rdfs/sub-class-of "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Implementation")
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#SecretRef")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#environmentCode"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Environment")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#deployVersion"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Deployment")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#gitSha"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Deployment")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#bindingName"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Binding")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#bindingKind"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Binding")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#routeHost"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Route")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#routePath"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Route")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#secretName"
     :rdfs/domain "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#SecretRef")
   (owl/datatype-property :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#secretLocation"
