        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Workspace"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)])

   ;; ---- Automation / drift detection ----
   ;; Bots and automations are tenant workload; the automation is
   ;; created STOPPED (automationEnabled recorded explicitly, never
   ;; implied true; P2 creates them disabled by default).
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Bot")
