        :sh/class "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#ObservedState"
        :sh/min-count 1 :sh/max-count 1)])

   ;; ---- Contract ----
   ;; Legal/business agreements. Bodies stay in private storage;
   ;; the graph carries summaries + obligations only (Plan constraint).
   ;; Persons are role-only (PartyRole); no PII.
   (owl/class :id "https://mithril.fund/ns/workspace-ops/v1#Agreement")
